MID_SE_Die_Lil_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Die_Lil_C_001: Today's hunt is going great! And I think I spy my\nnext quarry right over there.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_C_002: Come out, little birdie, so I can eat you.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_C_003: What the—Diego?!
MID_SE_Die_Lil_C_004: Hm.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_C_005: Don't startle me like that! I was ready to shoot the\nnext thing that popped out of those bushes.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_C_006: Sorry for disturbing your hunt.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_C_007: It's fine. At least I noticed before I fired. Hey, what's\nwith the armload of wood and grass?
MID_SE_Die_Lil_C_008: I'm picking herbs. Better to stockpile them now so\nwe don't run out later.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_C_009: Gotcha. But isn't it tough to tell the difference\nbetween the good herbs and the poisonous ones?
MID_SE_Die_Lil_C_010: I was a Har Hali warrior. We spend most of our lives\nin the forest.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_C_011: Wow. And the wood? Is that stuff used to make\nmedicine too?
MID_SE_Die_Lil_C_012: No, this is firewood. I burn it to smoke the meat for\nour rations.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_C_013: Mmm, smoked food. Can you spare a bite for me?\nSomeone just spoiled my hunt.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_C_014: Heh. Fine.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_C_015: Thanks! Mmmm. Oh, yum! The meat's seasoned\nwith the smoke and herbs.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_C_016: It's nothing special. I dry the meat for three days,\ncoat it with the herbs, and then smoke it.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_C_017: "Nothing special"?! You could serve this in a\nrestaurant! Actually, maybe you should.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_C_018: I could hunt the birds and you could smoke them to\nsell at market. What do you think?
MID_SE_Die_Lil_C_019: I'm not in this for money. All I want is something\nto keep me fed and alive a little longer.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_C_020: But it's such a good idea. With meat this delicious,\nwe'd be making money hand over fist!
MID_SE_Die_Lil_C_021: There's nothing wrong with getting paid. All that\nlabor deserves compensation.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_C_022: And I bet Orchel would be happy to see everyone\ngush over your food.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_C_023: You had to bring her into this...
MID_SE_Die_Lil_C_024: Compensation, huh? I never thought about it\nthat way, but maybe.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_C_025: C'mon, let's make some cash together! We'll split\nthe profits.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_C_026: Alright. But the business side is all you. I'll stick to\nmaking the stuff.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_001: Hey, are you done yet? That smells so good that I\nwant some right now.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_002: Be patient. Let the flavor of the herbs soak into\nthe meat.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_003: That should do it. Try some.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_004: Whoa...your smoked meat is incredible! Is this really\nthe same bird I hunted?
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_005: You and me are going to make SO much money!
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_006: But I think we'll do better selling it wholesale than\npeddling them door-to-door. So let's get to work!
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_007: You get to work. My part is done.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_008: What, leaving already? You're not interested to see\nhow it goes?
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_009: Ahh... Alright. Though I won't be much use to you.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_010: It's unbelievably good. You'd be a fool not to sell\nthis stuff!
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_011: Hmm. Sure, you've always brought me quality meat.\nBut this...I don't know.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_012: Come on. Come onnn! Do it for me?
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_013: Our reputation rests on us only selling the highest-\nquality food, though.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_014: Lilian provided the meat herself. She's a first-class\nhunter and knows how to drain the blood.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_015: What I'm trying to say is, we start with fresh meat.\nIt's the quality you're looking for. Just try it.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_016: Uhhh... Yeah, pretty much what he said.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_017: Well, now I'm curious. You don't mind if I sample\nit for myself?
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_018: Go for it! And don't feel like you gotta limit yourself\nto just one bite.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_019: Here goes, then. Oh! This is as good as you said—\nno, better!
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_020: This could be a signature menu item! I'll take the\nwhole parcel.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_021: Really?! Yesss! Thanks a ton.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_022: I knew they'd buy it! And it's all thanks to you.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_023: You've got a knack for salesmanship. Ever think\nabout going into business?
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_024: I was just telling the truth. You did good work.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_025: You really think so? 'Cause I'm not paying you more\nto be nice to me.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_026: That wasn't what I meant. Never mind. I'm out.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_027: Hey, one sec. Before you go, this is yours.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_028: Gotta compensate you properly, right? This is your\nshare. Thanks for the help!
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_029: Sure thing. See you around.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_030: Hmm? This is a lot. I thought we were going to split\nit evenly.
MID_SE_Die_Lil_B_031: Heh...that Lilian. Very classy.